              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hean iiwi jeeda madamnyeanda sabiibu bea gischeewoocheandaang'u, giimuusi aga sabiibooda niheas ea lang'uuda, ea gwadeena gidigasiidi, ak ea majiina eara dugusu ng'ay jeeda dabicheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
