          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak iiwi jeeda booga miinaada bea gischeewoocheandaang'u, giimuusi hirja muschoonga aba geatindaang'u, ak ea adiidu giibuuti barda jeeda booga miinaada bea gischeewoocheandaang'u.",
          "type": "text",
